			(property "Description" "Special Ordering/Production Instructions Alert\n\nSymbol for special PCB ordering instructions or unique production process warnings.\n\nOrdering InstructionsProduction Instructions\n\nTypes of information that should be added to box:\n\n• Copper weight\n• Soldermask color\n• Silk color\n• PCB thickness\n• Number of layers\n\nPCB Standard:\n\n• 1.6mm FR4\n• 1 oz copper\n• immersion silver plating\n• red soldermask\n• white silkscreen\n\nTypes of information that should be added to box:\n\n• Special wash requirements\n• Depaneling instructions\n• Humidification\n• Glue curing\n\nDefault text settings:\n\n• 0.07 inch\n• 9% ratio\n• 50% line distance"
